{"availability":"available","full":"oce-ai/oce","name":"oce","description":"OpenContextEngine is a self-hosted, ACE-compatible code retrieval service. It indexes source files with cAST-aware chunking, stores metadata in PostgreSQL or SQLite, performs dense vector retrieval in Milvus 3.0, and reranks results with an LLM before coverage-aware selection.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":121,"forks":16,"created":"2026-08-27T01:03:32Z","updated":"2026-10-08T09:43:00Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://oce-ai.github.io/oce-admin","topics":["ace","code-retrieval","codebase-retrieval","context-engine","context-engineering","oce","open-source"],"demo":"https://oce-ai.github.io/oce-admin","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:26.620Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:26.620Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:26.620Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:26.620Z","stars":121,"forks":16}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Self-hosted, ACE-compatible code retrieval for AI coding agents.","OpenContextEngine (OCE) gives AI coding agents accurate, up-to-date context from your codebase. It indexes source files with semantic (cAST) chunking, retrieves with hybrid dense + exact + path recall, reranks with an LLM, and returns a coverage-aware selection — all behind an ACE-compatible HTTP API you host yourself."],"features":["Client: — workspace sync, retrieval CLI, and MCP server","Hybrid retrieval — concurrent dense semantic recall (Milvus 3.0), exact identifier lookup (symboloccurrences), and an independent path index, fused with weighted rank fusion.","cAST-aware chunking — tree-sitter parsing splits source along semantic boundaries instead of blind line windows.","LLM reranking + coverage-aware selection — base rerank, optional LLM rerank, then greedy bin-packing that prioritizes repository coverage, suppresses overlapping spans, caps chunks per path, and respects a hard…","Query decomposition — multi-facet requests split into one complete query plus bounded facet queries, each recalled independently and fused before reranking."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/oce-ai/oce/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"1d7eea4c32a3356824425246d04b8ee1aae1ca40f52857b5f2d05bbff64de2af","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:26.775Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:26.775Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Self-hosted, ACE-compatible code retrieval for AI coding agents.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/oce-ai/oce/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Both modes need one thing you provide: an OpenAI-compatible embedding service — either a hosted provider key or a local inference server (e.g. llama-server).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/oce-ai/oce/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"1d7eea4c32a3356824425246d04b8ee1aae1ca40f52857b5f2d05bbff64de2af","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/oce-ai/oce/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:26.776Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T09:43:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/oce-ai/oce/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:26.777Z","hash":"1d7eea4c32a3356824425246d04b8ee1aae1ca40f52857b5f2d05bbff64de2af","originalBytes":17856,"storedBytes":17856,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["oce","query","run","api","bench","retrieval","milvus","rerank","domain","llm","recall","app","end","rewrite","source","admin","client","default","dense","direction","exact","intent","mode","optional","path","redis","runs","subgraph","host","key","opencontextengine","per","promote","service","sweep","top","version","cast","changes","chunk","code","compare","dependencies","dev","docs","each","embed","embedding","files","floor","full","fuse","hits","index","infra","local","max","merge","one","panel","pathcheck","port","profile","repo","restart","rrf","selec